LinkTalk is a derivative work (Android client, walkie-talkie and intercom-panel modes,
black/orange interface, Docker packaging) based on:

  Talktome
  https://github.com/thepoison606/talktome
  Copyright Daniel Jocher (thepoison606)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

  Talktome Apple prototype (thepoison606/talktome-apple @ 004d6e76)
  Copyright Daniel Jocher
  Reused with written permission.

Ported TypeScript files under src/protocol, src/auth, src/servers, src/signaling,
src/ble and src/audio name the original Swift type and commit in a file header.
The BLE GATT map and short-press lock policy come from BluetoothButtonController.swift
@ 004d6e76. Audio profiles and background receive keepalive come from AudioController.swift
@ 004d6e76.

Changes by makss1c: renamed to LinkTalk; removed iOS/watchOS targets; added launch mode
selection (walkie-talkie / intercom panel); new walkie-talkie screen; black/orange
Riedel-style theme; Russian interface for new screens; About screen; Docker packaging.
